WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.483 --> 00:00:06.328
Making a quiz is half the fun! Press New quiz, give it a name, and off you go.

2
00:00:06.829 --> 00:00:12.289
Type a question and its answers, then tick the right one. Everything saves as you type!

3
00:00:13.984 --> 00:00:19.594
Pick an answer type: true or false, typed answers, numbers, order, pins and pairs.

4
00:00:20.094 --> 00:00:23.845
Add a picture, and reveal it bit by bit while the clock runs.

5
00:00:24.346 --> 00:00:27.910
Slides open each round, with a title and a picture.

6
00:00:28.794 --> 00:00:34.424
Short on ideas? Grab questions from the library, one by one or at random!

7
00:00:34.925 --> 00:00:39.749
The strip on the side jumps anywhere in a long quiz, and the table view shows it all at once.

8
00:00:42.326 --> 00:00:47.558
Then test it: the big screen and two phones, side by side. Ready for quiz night!
